  "verseCount": 11,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "50",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 50"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "50",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 50:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thus saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.50.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.50.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", Where",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.50.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.50.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the bill of your mother's divorcement, whom I have put away? or which of my creditors",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.50.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.50.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to whom I have sold you? Behold, for your iniquities have ye sold yourselves, and for your transgressions is your mother put away.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 50:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wherefore, when I came,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "was there",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.50.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.50.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "no man? when I called,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "was there",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.50.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.50.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "none to answer? Is my hand shortened at all, that it cannot redeem? or have I no power to deliver? behold, at my rebuke I dry up the sea, I make the rivers a wilderness: their fish stinketh, because",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.50.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.50.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "no water, and dieth for thirst.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 50:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I clothe the heavens with blackness, and I make sackcloth their covering.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 50:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Lord",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "GOD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.50.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.50.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hath given me the tongue of the learned, that I should know how to speak a word in season to",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "him that is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.50.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.50.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "weary: he wakeneth morning by morning, he wakeneth mine ear to hear as the learned.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 50:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ The Lord",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "GOD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.50.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.50.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hath opened mine ear, and I was not rebellious, neither turned away back.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 50:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I gave my back to the smiters, and my cheeks to them that plucked off the hair: I hid not my face from shame and spitting.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 50:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ For the Lord",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "GOD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.50.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.50.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "will help me; therefore shall I not be confounded: therefore have I set my face like a flint, and I know that I shall not be ashamed.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 50:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "He is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.50.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.50.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "near that justifieth me; who will contend with me? let us stand together: who",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.50.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.50.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mine adversary? let him come near to me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 50:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, the Lord",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "GOD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.50.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.50.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "will help me; who",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.50.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.50.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.50.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.50.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shall condemn me? lo, they all shall wax old as a garment; the moth shall eat them up.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 50:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Who",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.50.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.50.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "among you that feareth the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.50.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.50.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", that obeyeth the voice of his servant, that walketh",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "in",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.50.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.50.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "darkness, and hath no light? let him trust in the name of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.50.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.50.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and stay upon his God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 50:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, all ye that kindle a fire, that compass",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "yourselves",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.50.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.50.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "about with sparks: walk in the light of your fire, and in the sparks",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.50.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.50.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ye have kindled. This shall ye have of mine hand; ye shall lie down in sorrow.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.50.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.50.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
